{
    "content1": {
        "content": "Performance Debugging",
        "type": "heading",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content2": {
        "content": "If your app feels sluggish, use the Performance Overlay to diagnose the issue.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content3": {
        "content": "1. Performance Overlay",
        "type": "sub-heading",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content4": {
        "content": "Shows two graphs: GPU thread and UI thread. If either exceeds 16ms, you'll drop frames.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content5": {
        "content": "MaterialApp(\n  showPerformanceOverlay: true,\n  home: ...\n);",
        "type": "code",
        "typeOf": "code"
    },
    "content6": {
        "content": "2. Common Issues",
        "type": "sub-heading",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content7": {
        "content": "Expensive operations in `build()` methods, lack of `const` widgets, and unoptimized images are common culprits.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content8": {
        "content": "Summary",
        "type": "heading",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content9": {
        "content": "Test performance on a low-end device to ensure a smooth experience for all users.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content10": {
        "content": "break",
        "type": "break",
        "typeOf": "break"
    }
}